  "content": "\n\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/cQkb8LEsiqg\" width=\"560\" height=\"314\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p>\n<h2 style=\"text-align:center!important\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fjoshie.app%252fmods%252fblossom-blade\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://joshie.app/files/joshie_app_download.svg\" alt=\"joshie-app\" height=\"112\"></a></h2>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h2 style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fdatapack%252fblossom-blade\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy-minimal/available/modrinth_vector.svg\" alt=\"modrinth\" height=\"56\"></a>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<a href=\"https://discord.gg/HUMbRQhxdR\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy-minimal/social/discord-plural_vector.svg\" alt=\"discord-plural\" height=\"56\"></a>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@joshieman\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy-minimal/social/youtube-plural_vector.svg\" alt=\"youtube-plural\" height=\"56\"></a>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fpaypal.me%252fjoshieman\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy-minimal/donate/paypal-plural_vector.svg\" alt=\"paypal-plural\" height=\"56\"> </a></h2>\n<h4 style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</h4>\n<h4 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#7e8c8d\">插在基座上的劍散發著聖潔的光芒，每一次揮舞都伴隨著櫻花的芬芳。</span></h4>\n<h1><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/920268/description_3e1a24d5-de12-47f8-bcbd-01f10216c892.png\" width=\"500\" height=\"500\"><br><br>特色</h1>\n<p><strong>新結構：</strong>Blossom Blade 會生成於櫻樹林生物群落中，包含一把同時附帶毀滅與鋒利附魔的鐵劍 &nbsp;<br><br></p>\n<h1>相容性</h1>\n<p>只要保留原版櫻樹林生物群落，即可與任何世界生成或生物群落相容。 &nbsp; <br><br></p>\n<h1>原版友善</h1>\n<p>僅使用原版方塊。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>",
